
### 1. 상품 생성 (POST - 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "테스트 상품",
  "price": 1000
}

### 2. 전체 상품 조회 (GET - 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items


### 3. 상품 수정 (PUT - 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "수정된 상품",
  "price": 2000
}

### 4. 상품 삭제 (DELETE - 200 OK)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1


### 5. 잘못된 상품 입력 (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -100
}

### 6. 존재하지 않는 상품 조회 (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/9999

### 7. 서버 오류 테스트 (500 Internal Server Error)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/test/server-error

### 8. 서비스 이용 불가 테스트 (503 Service Unavailable)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/test/service-unavailable
